\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces IDD diagnosis pipeline (v6.5). Deterministic statistical tooling (Steps 0--3) feeds LLM reasoning under a competing-hypotheses protocol (Step 4); parallel judge and physics pre-audit gates (5a/5b) may trigger bounded repair loops ($\le $3 per fault, global cap 5, anti-oscillation confidence cap 0.50); a final physics audit (Step 7) must return ENDORSED before delivery, and the finalisation gate (CP-9) aggregates inventory, schema, closure, judge-cross-audit, and event-log checks into a single PASS/FAIL verdict. Every transition is appended to a machine-verifiable event log.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{3}{IDD diagnosis pipeline (v6.5). Deterministic statistical tooling (Steps 0--3) feeds LLM reasoning under a competing-hypotheses protocol (Step 4); parallel judge and physics pre-audit gates (5a/5b) may trigger bounded repair loops ($\le $3 per fault, global cap 5, anti-oscillation confidence cap 0.50); a final physics audit (Step 7) must return ENDORSED before delivery, and the finalisation gate (CP-9) aggregates inventory, schema, closure, judge-cross-audit, and event-log checks into a single PASS/FAIL verdict. Every transition is appended to a machine-verifiable event log}{figure.1}{}}
